{"3423760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forgotten Eras", "steam_appid": 3423760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten Eras is the story of a young hero, Ivan, in a thrilling and epic adventure. He is on a mission to save the Kingdom and reverse the rituals of shamans who broke the sealed book of forgotten runic magic. Unlock the power of Veles and connect with Grey Wolf. Do you have the courage it takes to reach the Baba Yaga Hut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/654941c39050244af2e4fbcd5e9da155.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/654941c39050244af2e4fbcd5e9da155.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the Story with Morana.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destiny is never fixed. Guided by gods and haunted by spirits, Ivan must save the creatures of the forest and uncover the truth behind Slavic legends. Every choice reshapes the story — will you heal the land or let it wither under eternal winter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/f821ccefc6d916407ec04d564d040f82.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/f821ccefc6d916407ec04d564d040f82.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a Fast and Acrobatic Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across ruins, scale cursed trees, dodge enchanted traps, and bend the environment to your will. Forgotten Eras blends platforming with fluid Metroidvania exploration where every movement counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/22d22cf6f7ce61d779de8f0048dc81cf.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/22d22cf6f7ce61d779de8f0048dc81cf.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Own Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the legendary sword Kladenets, summon the Grey Wolf in combat, or strike from afar with the bow. Discover runic powers that unlock new strategies against spirits, witches, and beasts born of folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/c39cbd2a134bca30bd3b6b0cbcb96ffa.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/c39cbd2a134bca30bd3b6b0cbcb96ffa.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Truly Unique Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are the same. Face bosses like the Domovoy or Baba Yaga under the mist’s curse or the forest’s Leshy. Each trial tests your skill, courage, and choices, leading to a new path through myth, magic, and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to step into Forgotten Eras? Join our Discord Server to share your Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten Eras is the story of a young hero, Ivan, in a thrilling and epic adventure. He is on a mission to save the Kingdom and reverse the rituals of shamans who broke the sealed book of forgotten runic magic. Unlock the power of Veles and connect with Grey Wolf. Do you have the courage it takes to reach the Baba Yaga Hut?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/654941c39050244af2e4fbcd5e9da155.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/654941c39050244af2e4fbcd5e9da155.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite the Story with Morana.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destiny is never fixed. Guided by gods and haunted by spirits, Ivan must save the creatures of the forest and uncover the truth behind Slavic legends. Every choice reshapes the story — will you heal the land or let it wither under eternal winter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/f821ccefc6d916407ec04d564d040f82.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/f821ccefc6d916407ec04d564d040f82.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a Fast and Acrobatic Style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across ruins, scale cursed trees, dodge enchanted traps, and bend the environment to your will. Forgotten Eras blends platforming with fluid Metroidvania exploration where every movement counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/22d22cf6f7ce61d779de8f0048dc81cf.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/22d22cf6f7ce61d779de8f0048dc81cf.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Own Way</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield the legendary sword Kladenets, summon the Grey Wolf in combat, or strike from afar with the bow. Discover runic powers that unlock new strategies against spirits, witches, and beasts born of folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/c39cbd2a134bca30bd3b6b0cbcb96ffa.poster.avif?t=1770633475\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/extras/c39cbd2a134bca30bd3b6b0cbcb96ffa.webm?t=1770633475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One More Truly Unique Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are the same. Face bosses like the Domovoy or Baba Yaga under the mist’s curse or the forest’s Leshy. Each trial tests your skill, courage, and choices, leading to a new path through myth, magic, and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to step into Forgotten Eras? Join our Discord Server to share your Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Explore a Slavic folklore-inspired 2.5D Metroidvania. Guide Ivan and the Grey Wolf through a mythic kingdom, wield runes, solve puzzles, and face legends such as Domovoy and Baba Yaga reborn in a stylized, atmospheric world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Czech, Greek, Hungarian, Polish, Romanian, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/d83f931b1cc2180fdd327224dda18b79c4d1bb57/header.jpg?t=1770633475", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/18062e5200fe228729e8200c0ff09b3d1d729e70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770633475", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423760/18062e5200fe228729e8200c0ff09b3d1d729e70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770633475", "website": "https://behindthehump.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 3.4 GHz, AMD Ryzen3 1200 3.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (8GB VRAM) or AMD Radeon RX 5500 XT (8GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700 3.4 GHz, AMD Ryzen5 1600 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</